@startuml
title Round Management Activity Diagram
|Coordinator|
start
:Create Review Round (or Start Next Round);
:Set Round Deadline;

|System|
:Suggest Eligible Reviewers;
note right: Based on Interests,\nAvailability, Parent Paper Author

|Author|
:Propose Reviewer(s) (optional);

|Coordinator|
:Review Suggestions & Author Proposals;
:Select and Assign Reviewers;

|System|
:Send Invitation Emails;

|Coordinator|
while (Round Active?) is (Yes)
  switch (Choose Action)
  case (Send Reminder)
    :Manually Send Reminder to Reviewer(s);
  case (Edit Deadline)
    :Edit Round Deadline;
  case (Reassign)
    :Reassign Reviewer;
    note right: Triggered by decline approval\nor manual choice
  case (Wait)
    :Monitor Review Progress;
  endswitch
endwhile (No, Close Round)

|Coordinator|
:Close Round;

stop
@enduml
